{'symbol': 'BXP', 'date': '2023-03-29 16:15:00', 'title': 'BXP EARNS 2023 ENERGY STAR® SUSTAINED EXCELLENCE AWARD', 'text': 'BOSTON--(BUSINESS WIRE)--BXP (NYSE: BXP), THE LARGEST PUBLICLY TRADED DEVELOPER, OWNER, AND MANAGER OF PREMIER WORKPLACES IN THE UNITED STATES, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS RECEIVED THE 2023 ENERGY STAR PARTNER OF THE YEAR—SUSTAINED EXCELLENCE AWARD FROM THE U.S. ENVIRONMENTAL PROTECTION AGENCY AND THE U.S. DEPARTMENT OF ENERGY FOR THE THIRD CONSECUTIVE YEAR. THE SUSTAINED EXCELLENCE AWARD IS THE HIGHEST HONOR BESTOWED BY THE ENERGY STAR PROGRAM.'}